Z||000002||Bob Englert||10-10-2000||03:49 PM||||I agree with the vote for GM Synchromesh fluid.  I recently replaced the fluid in my 85 SE Isuzu 5sp with Synchromesh and I am sure the shifting is smoother and lighter.  The car does seem to go into gear better.<P>Pricy stuff but available at any GM dealer I think.||||reg||1
